ist_item":"- [ ] Either add a fixture-based test that exercises the reviewer on a lockstep-compliant diff and a justified-divergence diff (asserting zero findings) and on a real one-sided change (asserting a finding), OR soften the AC to state the guards are PRESENT in the prompt (text-level) with behavioral efficacy explicitly deferred to the later calibration ticket.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["E6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.5375,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["AC: '... so a compliant lockstep change or a justified divergence returns no finding.'","Testing enumerates structural asserts (OVERLAY_IDS membership, routing shape, threshold_for, glob firing/inert, dispatch, drift) but no fixture that runs the reviewer against a lockstep-compliant diff and a justified-divergence diff to confirm zero findings.","The behavioral claim ('returns no finding') is currently proven only by presence of guard text in the prompt, not by exercising the changed path."],"finding":"The AC that the reviewer prompt 'carries the false-positive guards ... so a compliant lockstep change or a justified divergence returns no finding' asserts a BEHAVIORAL outcome (the reviewer suppresses a justified divergence and fires on a real one), but no described testing step exercises the reviewer's actual finding/suppression judgment — the tests only assert wiring (id membership, routing shape, glob firing, dispatch) and prompt-text PRESENCE of the guards, not that the guards actually work.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fbb3d6f7613608ca8","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance Criteria line 6 ('The reviewer prompt carries the false-positive guards ...') and Testing section","norm_id":"nebadbec7b4701b38","priority":0.4125,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A guard is present in prose but the prompt still fires on a justified divergence (false positive) — the wiring tests all pass and the completion verdict is signed, yet the coaching value regresses.","A future prompt edit weakens a guard; no test catches the regression because none exercises the judgment."],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"Reword AC6 to 'The reviewer prompt CONTAINS the three false-positive guard clauses (deliberate justified divergence; adapter-bound non-caller-visible params; internal-only refactors), asserted via a prompt-text test; behavioral efficacy is calibrated in the follow-on promotion ticket' — aligning the claim with what the described steps actually prove.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"underspecified_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"underspecified_certification","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["AC item '[operator-attested] `make lint` + `make typecheck` pass; new unit tests green.' is [operator-attested] but its provenance declaration is incomplete (environment is missing (no provenance declaration found); principal is missing (no provenance declaration found)